{"id":370,"date":"2021-07-14T18:02:26","date_gmt":"2021-07-14T18:02:26","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/?p=370"},"modified":"2026-05-22T19:20:32","modified_gmt":"2026-05-22T19:20:32","slug":"musiqology-editorial","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2021\/07\/14\/musiqology-editorial\/","title":{"rendered":"Musiqology (Editorial)"},"content":{"rendered":"\r\n<figure>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\">Musiqology \u2014 Editorial Design<\/h1>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Role:<\/strong> In-House Creative <strong>Scope:<\/strong> Website &amp; Editorial Design<\/p>\r\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Overview<\/h2>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Musiqology was a music and culture editorial platform built around the scholarship and artistry of Dr. Guthrie Ramsey and collaborating artists. As the in-house creative, I was responsible for designing the full digital editorial experience \u2014 from homepage to article layout.<\/p>\r\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">The Work<\/h2>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">I designed the end-to-end website experience for Musiqology, creating a platform that could present music journalism and cultural commentary with the visual sophistication the content deserved.<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">The scope included homepage design, full site design, and article\/content layout \u2014 each requiring its own creative thinking. The homepage had to draw readers in and signal the platform&#8217;s point of view immediately. Article layouts had to be clean and readable while still feeling distinctly Musiqology. Together, the site functioned as both a publication and a cultural statement.<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">The editorial design system was built to be consistent enough to feel like a cohesive publication, and flexible enough to serve a wide range of content \u2014 essays, interviews, reviews, and artist features.<\/p>\r\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Legacy<\/h2>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">The editorial framework developed for Musiqology laid the groundwork for the platform&#8217;s evolution into Musiqology Media, demonstrating the lasting impact of intentional design systems built for scale.<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><em>This project is part of a broader creative system developed for Musiqology \u2014 see also: Musiqology Brand Identity.<\/em><\/p>\r\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Disciplines<\/h2>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Editorial Design \u00b7 Web Design \u00b7 Art Direction \u00b7 Content Layout \u00b7 Typography<\/p>\r\n<\/figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"372\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2021\/07\/14\/musiqology-editorial\/bobmarly2\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/bobmarly2.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1024,575\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-title=\"bobmarly2\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/w